                  <nc xml:id="m-bc701c38-3783-4c4f-a0b5-94a0252d0140" pname="f" oct="3" tilt="se" /></neume></syllable><custos xml:id="m-c16acdae-d302-46fb-831b-3796dee66b48" facs="#m-7721ace3-b46f-474d-ab53-31b1ee3a0e8b" pname="f" oct="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-5a350dea-02bb-4721-835f-4e13922257da"><lg xml:id="m-99ec9fa9-3be2-4c77-86e3-20653e0b6473"><l xml:id="m-e44375da-a13c-467b-9876-36120fb07245" facs="#m-69986646-653b-4853-a0bf-1f4f909298ea" label="ambiguous">June 26.</l><l xml:id="m-bcf1839d-03c8-4929-8edc-82bac80f5cd5" facs="#m-99f61f3d-e509-431f-a637-0d4c691b32eb" label="ambiguous">1509</l><l xml:id="m-a135135d-df1f-4172-a167-22dd3e536433" facs="#m-d0e3c931-33d3-4200-8994-73bc5dfccec3" label="lyrics-like">Dó- mi- ne, beneds-ces jú-sto: Dó-mine,</l><l xml:id="m-10d51813-cf88-4603-a88b-1e7a9990d2bc" facs="#m-329fc76e-d140-4e6a-b66f-083e4fe53e5f" label="ambiguous">ut</l><l xml:id="m-fd249309-d647-4c04-96ca-774920818048" facs="#m-99d0020c-3276-48ea-a6bd-ad1a681aefb3" label="lyrics-like">scú-to bónae vo-luntá-tis tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-04c69737-7275-48da-8240-306a54dbafc3" facs="#m-33d289a3-74dd-4fef-ac64-2731235602f7" label="lyrics-like">ae co¬ ro- násti nos.</l><l xml:id="m-ddac0191-87fa-45e4-b7e8-4d8a17b143f3" facs="#m-09c90f02-f927-403f-b276-0db53898f1e8" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-752cf271-7d09-4815-ab98-48261fbc0048" facs="#m-ffe2e618-5331-4196-8335-d24ae5272767" label="lyrics-like">Ostias tibi, Dómine, sanctórum! súme: et ad perpétuum nobis tri¬</l><l xml:id="m-5b1e384f-c532-489e-b279-dd51e137bfd5" facs="#m-d6a79b1f-e705-43a6-a876-f7d320ae62e5" label="lyrics-like">It Mártyrum tuórum Joánnis et l bue provenire subsidium. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-690b162a-45ad-4e8c-b6d5-023dc57f7263" facs="#m-b1de4d8a-0b07-43c6-bf87-4827e8349d09" label="lyrics-like">Pauli dicátas méritis, benignus as-lminum.</l><l xml:id="m-32ef3e93-c83e-4cd6-a995-4dc67d28b11e" facs="#m-bba5e44d-1f5b-4589-8189-82d0762eb76a" label="lyrics-like">Orthe Octave of St. John. Secret. Tua Dómine. p. 1502.</l><l xml:id="m-765dafd6-0e46-462c-802d-80f7a8270067" facs="#m-afec224a-ff66-44fa-a070-ec9288eba30c" label="ambiguous">Communton. Et si coram hominibus. p. 1166.</l><l xml:id="m-78f5b5d0-3d9d-4859-a4ba-a7874f386123" facs="#m-9aac72fa-b8b3-4661-b6f2-68618f7ca6f7" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-eae5afd6-16a3-424b-8ae5-8064d8b47d69" facs="#m-5165d6d2-b50d-4ef8-bbdd-019800499492" label="lyrics-like">TUmpsimus, Dómine, sanctórum! mus; ut, quod temporáliter gérimus,</l><l xml:id="m-f341df56-2e76-45b4-9a95-6b8d9e20e3c0" facs="#m-2a84918f-8c70-4a2d-b786-0eb65f6818b9" label="lyrics-like">O Martyrum tuórum Joánnis etl aetérnis gaudiis consequámur. Pei</l><l xml:id="m-c07623bc-11fe-48a9-8010-0eacda2cb50f" facs="#m-78ba0a51-b6c2-4e74-b8a5-3383a6442ff3" label="lyrics-like">Pauli solémnia celebrántes, sacra- Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-d906a61f-3e09-4019-9530-4800aa547630" facs="#m-c38d8a17-2fe3-4520-b631-d0939970cf6e" label="lyrics-like">ménta caeléstia : praesta, quaésu¬</l><l xml:id="m-a2454feb-6793-4d3a-9ce3-b50454b06ab2" facs="#m-1ac116a6-b576-4b92-bc7e-bd8d1df959bb" label="lyrics-like">Ofthe Octave of St. John. Postcommunion. Sumat Ecclésia tua. p. 1502.</l><l xml:id="m-325768c1-5346-48fd-b2a6-184d9e707e7f" facs="#m-f0a7a1d5-5ff6-4975-8bd0-98a47422f58b" label="text-like">At Second Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-d485385c-4eda-4e2c-ae68-8aa277d9671d" facs="#m-7f3cf160-bcb2-4d26-9616-d23a6ba5acc1" label="lyrics-like">Psalms. 1. Dixit Dóminus. 8. G. p. 133. — 2. Confitébor. 8. G. p. 140.—</l><l xml:id="m-91515845-d43f-4e11-b61c-3b573be4b466" facs="#m-557b9a99-3a0b-4285-bea3-eb42bd545b89" label="lyrics-like">3. Beátus vir. I. f. p. 140. — 4. Laudáte pueri. 1 a: . 118. — S. Cré¬</l><l xml:id="m-938baf54-1295-4c96-ae23-686ad890e435" facs="#m-4d95add2-41dc-4836-a7d4-957e63f9a4df" label="ambiguous">didi. 1. f. p. 16i.</l><l xml:id="m-1a1e2f1a-28f4-4ec0-be36-98fd407024ae" facs="#m-54f4f07b-6b20-4471-b2d4-4d2593dee265" label="ambiguous">1.Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-f2ad70c9-5e36-4eb6-a422-49b077b73e89" facs="#m-d074fc98-37f9-4d5b-8f30-115b164f19f7" label="ambiguous">8.6</l><l xml:id="m-da897a01-1e43-4efa-a220-5e432b1a6499" facs="#m-02a441f9-43d3-4fea-a187-e72620e264bd" label="lyrics-like">Aulus et Jo-ánnes“ dixérunt Ju-li- áno: Nos únum</l><l xml:id="m-14f33fce-d61a-4875-ab1a-2f8515af9f6b" facs="#m-d097fd11-f1da-4461-bbc5-97c5583528fd" label="lyrics-like">Dé-um có-limus, qui fé cit caélum et térram. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-7f9a7f9b-d514-4c15-a731-29a9be015b94" facs="#m-6a2360a4-175e-4a00-be13-f6173da97eee" label="ambiguous">2. Ant.E</l><l xml:id="m-ba8fb1d5-bff7-4a6b-8997-d23ff85241ef" facs="#m-e87ad01e-8952-44dc-940d-7d15d71e025e" label="ambiguous">8.6</l><l xml:id="m-380ec0f6-a9ac-4321-a8ed-e21b8eea30cf" facs="#m-4439216c-1181-49b6-b5d3-561e5a14c9d7" label="lyrics-like">Aulus et Jo-ánnes“ dixé-runt ad Terenti-á-num:</l><l xml:id="m-4a327d97-f2fe-46ea-8650-7e4e79da183e" facs="#m-c58edffd-a217-4ac3-af07-d815207d2ce6" label="lyrics-like">Si tú-us dómi-nus est Ju-li-ánus, ha-bé-to pácem cum il¬</l><l xml:id="m-bd13a9a8-a175-4af6-9944-b89f54d712a0" facs="#m-13a7a57d-481c-4799-a529-dcd2b21b0839" label="ambiguous">Ne sol. —2</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
